WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.850
I'm off!

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:13.350
Have a good time!

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.240
Morning, Aoi!

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:19.540
Morning!

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:24.380
The Nationals are finally on!

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:25.200
Yeah.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.980
We can't afford to lose.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.060
You're taking back real soccer, right?

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:30.920
Yeah.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.380
If we all work hard, things will work out somehow!

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.230
I'll be rooting for you, Tenma!

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:37.900
Yeah!

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:57.320
Now there's a new face.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:58.230
Who is he?

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:38.470
Let me tell you upfront.

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:44.260
From now on, Raimon will be fighting against the big dogs in the Nationals controlled by Fifth Sector.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:49.560
But remember that there's no such thing as an opponent you can't beat.

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:52.720
As long as you work together, you can win.

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:53.690
Right?

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:55.170
Yes, sir!

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.470
Not good enough!

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:10.210
Keep a sharper watch!

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:13.260
Sorry.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:15.770
Looks like we need to work harder.

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:16.600
Yeah.

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:18.600
They're all pumped!

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:22.500
There, Hayami!

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:24.020
O-Okay!{ww}

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:25.310
Shinsuke!

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:26.020
Yeah!

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:27.760
Tsurugi!

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:29.280
Here it comes!

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:32.940
Hayami!

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:38.610
Next!

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.050
Kurama!

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:45.580
Tenma!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.090
Okay!

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:53.290
All right, that was a good combo play!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:55.800
No, that wasn't good enough.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.300
One more time, please.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.520
Pass it faster, if you could.

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:04.260
Now look who's talking.

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:05.900
S-Sorry!

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:07.820
I must've sounded so stuck-up just now.

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:08.820
No need to apologize.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:09.890
That's right!

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:14.500
We're all on the same seniority level when we're on the pitch.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:15.890
Sangoku-senpai...

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:22.240
Okay!

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:26.850
It would've been nice if Minamisawa came back.

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:29.170
I can't believe he transferred schools.

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:32.950
Minamisawa-san transferred out?

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:35.530
Yeah, and he didn't tell us where he was going.

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:37.160
I see.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:40.130
After we've been playing soccer together all this time...

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:46.410
He has his own way of handling things.

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:51.740
Minamisawa-san will understand what we're trying to do here someday.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:53.100
Yeah.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:07.960
Tenma!

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:09.680
It's him.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:20.630
It's that guy!

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:25.890
Starting from today, Kariya Masaki-kun will be joining our class.

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:26.970
Make him feel welcome, okay?

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:29.760
I'm Kariya Masaki. Nice to meet you.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.860
Your seat is the open one over there.

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:32.390
Matsukaze!

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:33.790
Yes!

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:34.710
Here!

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:37.710
Thanks.

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:39.990
We met at the front gate this morning.

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:41.110
Do you remember?

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:42.040
Yeah.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:44.410
I'm Matsukaze Tenma. Nice to meet you!

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:46.650
Yeah, same here.

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.830
Hey, Kariya-kun.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:53.900
What?

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:55.450
Are you joining a club?

00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:01.750
I was thinking of joining the soccer club.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.120
Really?

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:06.240
We're in the soccer club! You play?

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:06.630
Yeah.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:08.570
What's your position?

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:09.730
Defender.

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:11.390
Then you're the same as me!

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:14.580
I'm Shinsuke. Nishizono Shinsuke!

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:15.270
Nice to meet you!

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:17.180
Yeah, nice to meet you.

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:20.060
Isn't that good news? We've got another member!

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:20.650
Yeah!

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:23.130
Hey, did you see the soccer building?

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:24.520
Let's go there together after school!

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:33.520
Hibiki Seigou has announced his candidacy for the Holy Emperor election.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.570
I see.

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:42.200
This is the first time a candidate outside Fifth Sector has appeared ever since your inauguration, Ishido-sama.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:46.240
He's taking advantage of Raimon's momentum to cause unrest.

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:48.090
This issue must be handled seriously.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:51.180
Hibiki Seigou, eh...

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.340
Here's the club room.

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:04.230
And this is...?

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:07.230
I'd like to join the soccer club.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:08.610
A new member?

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:09.740
He's a transfer student.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.950
Kariya Masaki-kun.

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:13.780
It's nice to meet you.

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:20.500
Then are we gonna start practice with the entrance exam?

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:21.950
Exam?

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:23.380
Oh, right!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.260
I forgot about the entrance exam.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:29.150
Kariya, do you like soccer?

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:35.430
Yes, sir.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:37.520
Okay.

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:38.910
You can join.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:40.880
What about the exam?

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:42.730
That was the exam just now.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:45.970
The point of a soccer club is that it's for people who like playing soccer, after all.

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:49.570
Coach...

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:52.300
That's true.

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:55.080
Sounds like something Coach Endou would do.

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:55.410
Yes.

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:57.980
Interesting.

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:03.700
We'll practice 2-on-2 for offense and defense.

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:07.530
Those on the offense will go for a shoot, and the defense will block it.

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:08.480
Yes, sir!

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:11.050
First on offense will be Tenma and Shindou.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:11.420
Yes, sir!

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:14.920
On defense will be Kirino... and Kariya.

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:15.610
Yes, sir!

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:17.090
Just like that?

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:18.930
I wonder how good he is.

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:22.540
Is that okay? He just joined in.

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:25.460
It's <i>because</i>  he just joined, he's being put to the test.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.830
Maybe it's to get him comfortable with the team.

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:28.320
They're starting.

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:31.280
Use your all whether you're attacking or defending!

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:32.510
Let's go.

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:33.200
Okay!

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:36.650
I won't let you through!

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:37.480
Tenma!

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:44.340
I can't shake him off.

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:03.160
You got me. That was impressive!

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:05.770
I just happened to get it this time somehow.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:06.870
It was a fluke.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:10.550
No, your speed and body balance are pretty good.

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:11.870
Thanks.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.490
This is <i>too</i>  easy.

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:18.990
Impressive, but it was a little on the rough side.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.580
That new recruit knows his stuff.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.260
Yeah, what a surprise!

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:27.250
But he's kind of...

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:29.880
Scary...

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:34.340
All right. Next group, you're up!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.290
Yes, sir!

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:44.340
Kidou-san?

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:45.050
Nii-san!

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.520
What're you doing here?

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:56.540
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.310
Inazuma Eleven...

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:01.880
GO!

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.630
What're you doing here?

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:12.630
I'm here to join Raimon as the trainer.

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:15.410
Seriously, Kidou?

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:17.050
Nii-san, what do you mean?

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:20.800
The battle from here on will only get tougher.

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:24.470
I'd like to lend my strength as well.

00:10:25.010 --> 00:10:27.310
Hibiki-san also asked me to.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:28.230
I see.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:32.110
All right, we'll be playing soccer together again!

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:38.960
Raimon's first opponent will be Gassan Kunimitsu.

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:40.110
Gassan Kunimitsu?

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:43.220
They were one of the top eight teams last year!

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:46.940
Weren't they a team that sent opponents to their knees even in the Nationals?

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:51.180
So Fifth Sector has come to take us down right in plain view.

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:52.130
That's the likely case.

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:54.300
But we won't lose!

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:05.720
Revolution, huh...

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:09.020
Yeah, so we have to keep winning.

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:12.940
Good work, Tsurugi!

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:18.340
I better keep working too.

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:23.690
How's it looking for the Nationals?

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:27.060
Well...

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:29.160
I'm getting along with them.

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:32.370
You're a full-fledged member of the team now, huh?

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:38.090
Keep up the winning streak in Holy Road, got it?

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.460
Yeah, just watch.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:46.180
A new member at this point?

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:50.210
He came in at a good time since Raimon is low on players.

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:54.390
Raimon has a long road ahead of itself.

00:11:54.390 --> 00:11:55.510
I'm counting on you.

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:56.430
Yeah.

00:11:56.430 --> 00:11:58.540
I'll be your support.

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:01.700
Just like the old days when you were Raimon's captain.

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:09.180
Kogure?

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:13.960
Endou-san!

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:15.210
And Kidou-san!

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:18.680
It <i>is</i>  you! It's been a while.

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:19.520
Yes.

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:23.060
Oh, right. This is where I work right now.

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:25.150
You've been working hard.

00:12:25.150 --> 00:12:26.390
It's a top-class company.

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:28.500
Well, yeah...

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:32.450
Excuse me a bit.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:34.760
Hello, it's Kogure.

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:36.860
Oh yes, about tomorrow?

00:12:37.470 --> 00:12:39.860
Yes, yes...

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:43.490
Canceled?! But this is so sudden!

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:45.410
Hello! Hello?!

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:48.540
Was that about work?

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:49.100
No...

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:53.360
Endou-san, you're Raimon's coach now, right?

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:54.060
Yeah.

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:57.380
Then let's go!

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.920
What, Kogure? Hey!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:11.430
Sasuke, time for dinner.

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:12.780
Thanks!

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:14.880
I was about to get it.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.830
Are you all heading out for practice?

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:22.750
Aki-san... I mean, Coach...

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:25.030
We're going out for a run to prepare for tomorrow.

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:27.950
Oh yeah, you said you were having a match tomorrow!

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:31.030
Hmph, we'll be so tired from running that we'll lose.

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:33.790
Don't say that! We'll win no matter what!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:37.290
I can see it! The moment of victory!

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:40.000
Thanks for all the caring!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.530
You're not making sense, Johnny.

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:44.470
Do your best tomorrow!

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:45.490
Yeah!

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:48.640
Oh, good timing!

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.240
Welcome back, Kogure-kun.

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:52.790
Oh, you live in Aki's apartment?

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:55.280
Yes, it helps me save up a lot.

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:57.640
Coach? Trainer Kidou?

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:02.080
What brings you both here all of a sudden?

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:02.650
Yo.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:03.760
It's been a while.

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:06.190
Welcome back, Kogure-chan~

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:08.860
What's this team?

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:11.330
They're the Akizora Challengers.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.990
It's a team made up by the residents of Kogarashi Manor.

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:16.970
Oh, so you're still playing soccer!

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:18.790
Who's this person?

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:23.490
Let me introduce you.

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:26.910
This is Coach Endou Mamoru of Raimon Jr. High's soccer club.

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:29.250
They're our opponent tomorrow.

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.220
A substitute team, huh...

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:39.230
Yes.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:43.400
We haven't had a match in a long time, but the other side canceled all of a sudden.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.740
My team was really looking forward to it.

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:48.710
I can't bring myself to tell them that the match is off.

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:50.510
So please, Endou-san!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:53.070
What should we do, Coach?

00:14:57.870 --> 00:15:02.890
Here at the riverbank, it's Raimon versus Akizora Challengers!

00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:06.010
The score is still 0-0 at the start of the second half!

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:08.630
Which team will make the first score?

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:15.390
Sidewinder!

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:23.780
Senpuujin!

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:31.330
Piece of cake!

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.390
Take it, Johnny!

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:36.990
You're not getting through!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.820
Oh, you're welcome!

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:41.110
I did it!

00:15:41.110 --> 00:15:41.960
Oh my God!

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:43.080
Tenma!

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:46.180
All right! Head right up there!

00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:49.400
Got it, guys?

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:51.260
Go right for the ball today.

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:54.950
Let's enjoy a game without worrying about revolutions or duty.

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:58.110
A match without any concerns, huh.

00:15:58.110 --> 00:16:00.210
I've forgotten how that feels!

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:02.190
This sounds like so much fun!

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.000
Yeah.

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:05.210
So I can do whatever I want...

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:06.310
Kariya.

00:16:06.870 --> 00:16:11.100
Rough plays like the one yesterday leave you open for the opponent to counter.

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:12.220
Be careful.

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:20.950
It's a chance for the Akizora Challengers!

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:25.050
I can see it!

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:27.540
A dreadful evil spirit!

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:31.380
Evil spirit, begone!

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:33.970
It worked!

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:38.530
Neither team is letting up!

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:41.000
The fierce battle rages on!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.480
Everyone, good luck!

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:44.520
Go, go!

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:49.080
Just what you'd expect from an adult team.

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:50.060
They're strong.

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:52.440
Yeah, but it's fun.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:54.360
They're really enjoying themselves.

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:58.380
There!

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:10.930
Oh, Kariya comes to the other side and clears the ball!

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:13.620
That was overstepping it!

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:16.430
You left your position wide open!

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:17.590
Sorry.

00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:23.310
I overheard the other team saying that <i>Kirino-san</i>  was Raimon's weak point.

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:26.130
What?

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:30.330
Don't talk out of line in the middle of a match.

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:32.430
I guess that did go over the line.

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:39.620
There's not much time in the second half!

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:42.130
Akizora Challengers are out on the counterattack!

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:43.830
Here it comes!

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:46.290
Yeah!

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:51.110
Damn it!{lol}

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:53.940
What?!

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:58.140
Oh no, it's an accidental clash between teammates!

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:06.990
Now it's Raimon's turn to attack!

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:08.730
Kariya's heading up!

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:09.680
Over here!

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:12.650
Don't underestimate me!

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:16.460
How's that?

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:17.480
Not enough!

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:22.740
Close, but no goal!

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:28.000
I can make a shoot too!

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:33.790
No good...

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:36.330
It's about time we showed them how serious we adults can get!

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:41.420
Yes! All thanks to you!

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:42.990
You're not getting past me!

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:47.100
Dance of the Wind God!

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:51.820
Yone-san, close it up!

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:53.060
Leave it to me!

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:58.730
Emperor Penguin...

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:02.180
No. 2!

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:05.870
There it is! Will it get in?

00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:11.790
Hunter's Net!

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:15.680
What?

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:17.540
That was an awesome hissatsu technique!

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:18.590
He blocks it!

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:20.630
Kariya saves them from a tight spot!

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:24.090
Time's almost up!

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:26.250
Will this be Raimon's last attack?

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:26.890
Tenma!

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.000
Yeah!

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:32.330
Full Throttle Jump!

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:39.620
I won't let it in!

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:42.160
Senpuujin!

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:47.810
Goal!

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:50.400
Raimon finally scores one!

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:53.620
Raimon really is amazing.

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:57.170
There's the end of the match!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:00.050
At 1-0, it's Raimon's victory!

00:20:03.980 --> 00:20:06.120
That was a good game, Kogure.

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:06.880
Yes!

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:09.020
Thank you so much for everything today.

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:13.060
That was a lot of fun. We should do it again, Endou-kun!

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:14.930
Yeah, let's!

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:18.990
Otonashi-sensei, thanks to you too.

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:21.110
Yes...

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:25.240
What's wrong?

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.400
Um, it's just...

00:20:28.550 --> 00:20:29.950
I won't pull pranks.

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:40.840
That was so much fun!

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:44.010
Shinsuke, that final goal was so awesome!

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:46.010
Yeah, it felt great!

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:46.560
Here.

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:51.460
That's a nice picture.

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:53.150
I'll make a print for you later.

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:54.490
Really?

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:56.090
Thank you!

00:20:56.090 --> 00:20:57.820
Hey, what about my shoot?

00:20:57.820 --> 00:20:59.510
It was blocked, so I deleted it.

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:06.140
It was fun to play after so long.

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:08.570
Yeah. Soccer really is great.

00:21:09.190 --> 00:21:12.930
Yeah, we need to bring back this fun.

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:21.020
What a waste of time.

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:24.580
Could that guy be...?

00:22:54.010 --> 00:22:56.720
It's finally the Holy Road's Nationals tournament!

00:22:56.720 --> 00:22:59.840
Are all the strong teams lined up going to be our opponents?

00:22:59.840 --> 00:23:04.230
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 Gather! At the Flag of Revolution!!

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:05.790
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.180 --> 00:23:17.910
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.990 --> 00:23:26.560
There's no such thing as an opponent you can't beat.

00:23:26.560 --> 00:23:27.280
That's all!
